    "text": "The area (in sq. units) of the region <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced open=\"{\" close=\"}\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>y</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>:</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>&#8804;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8804;</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfenced></math> is:",
